				<h1 id="versionHeadLine" class="headline">

AB MUNICIPAL ELECTION		</h1>
	
		<div id="cc5f7ba744-1911-40dd-85b2-32dde51ea500" data-containerid="5f7ba744-1911-40dd-85b2-32dde51ea500" class="pageContent cpGrid cpGrid24"  >
			

		<div class="row outer wide"><!--
--><div class="outer col col17 first" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="45cf3ff1-9497-49bc-909d-7b94f82d2d3e">				
	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col17 first last id3efa0a94-1122-42bf-8bb8-283949ee8170" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="3efa0a94-1122-42bf-8bb8-283949ee8170">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditora882cfc4-418d-4c42-8a6b-612bf7f39cc8" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>General Election - November 3, 2026</strong></span></strong></span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">The purpose of this upcoming election will be to fill the following Commission Seats:&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Offices up for election:</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Mayor/Commissioner- Seat 1</strong> (2-year term) - <strong>At Large</strong><br>Currently held by Curtis Ford</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>Commissioner- Seat 4</strong> (4-year term) - <strong>District 1306</strong><br>Currently held by Candace Kelly</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" data-pasted="true"><strong>Please Note: Jessica Ring (incumbent) qualified unopposed and is therefore considered (re)elected to the office of Commissioner - Seat 5</strong> (4-year term) - <strong>District 1312.&nbsp; As a result, Seat 5 will not be on the ballot.</strong></span><br><br></span><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong id="isPasted">All Atlantic Beach Commission Offices are elected <span style="text-decoration: underline;">at</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">-large</span>. &nbsp;AB registered voters can vote for candidates&nbsp;</strong><strong>of all seats up for election</strong><strong>, regardless of their district. &nbsp;A seat&rsquo;s district assignment relates to the residency requirements for candidates.</strong></span></p><h2 class="subhead1"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Residency requirements</span></span></h2><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">All candidates must have been full-time residents and electors of the city for at least four years immediately prior to qualifying, and must not hold any other elective office. Candidates for Seats 4 &amp; 5 are required to reside within the district for which they are seeking. <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" data-pasted="true">The Mayor has no district requirement. The Mayor and Commissioners are all elected At-Large.</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">If you&rsquo;d like to know which district you are in, please review the <a href="http://weblink.coab.us/WebLink/ElectronicFile.aspx?docid=655300&dbid=0&repo=CityofAtlanticBeach">district map</a> or enter your address on the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.duvalelections.gov/204/Polling-Location-Finder" target="_blank" rel="noopener">precinct finder page</a> on the Duval County Supervisor of Election&rsquo;s website. &nbsp;<br><br></span><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">The City Clerk serves as the filing officer for AB municipal elections. For more information, please contact the City Clerk. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>
    </div>

